1
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,320
Uh… auntie.

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,960
Uh…

3
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:16,480
Uh… where's Earth?

4
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:22,680
Master Earth? He didn't come home.
I thought he was with you, Gun.

5
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:25,660
Did he go missing?

6
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,869
Oh, uh—

7
00:00:28,033 --> 00:00:32,357
I came back and didn't see him.

8
00:00:32,357 --> 00:00:40,440
I'm… I'm just worried about him.
Oh…

9
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:47,559
Auntie, please don't tell my dad.
He'll scold me again.

10
00:00:47,719 --> 00:00:51,988
Oh come on, you care about him this much—
your father won't be angry.

11
00:00:51,988 --> 00:00:55,751
But fine, if you don't tell me,
I won't tell him.

12
00:00:55,751 --> 00:01:01,359
Why don't you call him yourself?

13
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:06,234
Oh, uh… well—

14
00:01:07,581 --> 00:01:11,059
I don't have Earth's number, auntie.

15
00:01:11,059 --> 00:01:14,387
Oh—then I'll give it to you.

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,226
Ah, thank you, auntie.

17
00:01:32,759 --> 00:01:36,720
What kind of sickness is this…

18
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:01,979
Alright…

19
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:15,760
Who's that?
Earth, your phone's ringing!

20
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,951
Hello?

21
00:02:18,951 --> 00:02:20,345
Where are you, man?

22
00:02:20,345 --> 00:02:23,842
This isn't Earth.

23
00:02:23,842 --> 00:02:29,280
Yeah? Then who the hell
are you talking to—
